    "created_at": "2016-05-05T16:12:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-05T16:12:53Z",
    "body": "In WebKit, assigning 0 to colgroup.span will set it to 1 (default value) instead (no exception thrown). Due to compatibility worries, we did not implement the \"Thrown an IndexSizeError if value is 0\" part of:\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#limited-to-only-non-negative-numbers-greater-than-zero\n",
