    "created_at": "2016-05-05T17:51:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-05T17:51:46Z",
    "body": "Throwing is generally lame, because it can inadvertently cause the whole page to break because of a small bug in some insignificant function.  So I think setting to the default value is better across the board, if some UAs already do it.  I'm not sure about input.size if we already have interop, though.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
