    "created_at": "2016-05-05T17:52:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-05T17:52:37Z",
    "body": "OK, so you would prefer to switch Firefox's behavior for textarea as well?\n\nThat would leave `input.size` as the only consumer of \"limited to only non-negative values greater than zero\", which is fine I guess.\n",
