    "created_at": "2016-05-05T17:53:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-05T17:54:03Z",
    "body": "I can't speak for Mozilla, but I doubt anyone here would have a problem taking a patch to switch to not throw for textarea.rows/.cols, if WebKit/Blink already do that.  I can guess WebKit/Blink would be more reluctant to take a patch to start throwing, particularly since IIUC there's significant amounts of WebKit-only content.\n",
