    "created_at": "2016-08-16T18:40:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-16T18:40:56Z",
    "body": "As I commented before, I would prefer not changing WebKit's behavior to start throwing in this case (mostly due to compatibility worries). WebKit falls back to using the default value which is the behavior I'd prefer to be spec'd.\n",
